  "confidence": "high",
  "decision_summary": "Predicted high: the query's N-arylpiperazine quinolinone scaffold is supported by multiple analogs with oral bioavailability well above 20% (eltoprazine ~95%, SB-742457 excellent, CAB near-complete, thalidomide 80-100%, ketanserin ~50%, pethidine ~50%). No credible evidence indicates F below 20%.",
